      "comment": "Initializes the server subsystems in sequence and returns overall success status.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call first subsystem initialization (FUN_68002230)\n2. Call second subsystem initialization (FUN_680022b0) \n3. Call third subsystem initialization (FUN_680022c0) and capture result\n4. Convert non-zero result to boolean true, zero result to boolean false\n5. Return overall initialization success status\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\ntrue  - All subsystems initialized successfully (third function returned non-zero)\nfalse - At least one subsystem failed to initialize (third function returned zero)\n\nSpecial Cases:\nThe function uses a specific bit manipulation pattern to convert int to bool:\n  NEG EAX    ; Set flags based on EAX != 0\n  SBB EAX,EAX ; EAX = (EAX was 0) ? 0 : -1  \n  NEG EAX    ; EAX = (EAX was -1) ? 1 : 0\n\nError Handling:\nOnly the third function's return value determines overall success.\nFirst two functions are called without checking their return status.",
