      "comment": "Processes dynamic import linking table to resolve function addresses at runtime.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if global import link table pointer is non-null\n2. If table is null, return success (1) immediately  \n3. Load first entry's module handle and function pointer destination\n4. For each table entry, validate module handle and destination pointer are non-null\n5. If either is null, return success (1) - table processing complete\n6. Call GetProcAddress with module handle and function name string\n7. Store resolved function address in destination pointer location\n8. If GetProcAddress fails (returns null), return failure (0)\n9. Load next entry pointer and advance to next table entry\n10. If next entry exists, continue loop at step 4\n11. If no more entries, return success (1)\n\nParameters:\n(none - function takes no parameters)\n\nReturns:\n1 = Success - All function addresses resolved successfully or table empty/complete\n0 = Failure - GetProcAddress failed to resolve at least one function address\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- Null table pointer: Returns success immediately (treated as empty table)\n- Null module handle in entry: Stops processing, returns success\n- Null destination pointer in entry: Stops processing, returns success  \n- GetProcAddress failure: Immediately returns failure without processing remaining entries\n\nStructure Layout:\nImportLinkEntry (12 bytes per entry):\nOffset | Size | Field Name      | Type    | Description\n0x00   | 4    | pModule        | void*   | Pointer to HMODULE handle\n0x04   | 4    | pFunctionPtr   | void*   | Pointer to destination function pointer\n0x08   | 4    | pFunctionName  | char*   | Pointer to function name string  \n0x0C   | 4    | pNext          | void*   | Pointer to next entry (or terminator)\n\nError Handling:\n- Invalid module handle: Treated as end-of-table condition\n- Invalid function pointer destination: Treated as end-of-table condition\n- Function name resolution failure: Returns 0 immediat