      "comment": "Cleanup client resource and finalize entity context.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get client context using g_pfnGetClientContext function pointer\n2. If client context is null, return 0 (early exit)\n3. Get client info structure using g_pfnGetClientInfo with client context\n4. If client info is null, skip resource cleanup but continue to finalization\n5. Check if resource pointer at offset 0x68 in client info is non-null\n6. If resource exists, call FUN_68006798 to cleanup the resource with resource ID\n7. Set resource pointer at offset 0x68 to null to prevent double-free\n8. Call g_pfnFinalizeEntity to finalize the entity context\n9. Return 0 to indicate successful cleanup\n\nParameters:\ndwResourceId - Resource identifier passed to cleanup function\n\nReturns:\n0 - Cleanup operation completed successfully\n\nSpecial Cases:\nOffset 0x68 - Pointer to resource data in client info structure\nMagic number 0x0 used for null pointer assignment after cleanup",
