      "comment": "Merges two sorted configuration item linked lists into destination list.\n\nAlgorithm:\n\n1. Early return if source and destination lists are the same object\n2. Initialize list head pointers from both containers (offset +0x4)\n3. Initialize current node pointers from list heads (offset +0x0)\n4. Main merge loop while both lists have unprocessed nodes:\n   a. Check if source list is exhausted, jump to tail merge if true\n   b. Retrieve string pointers from node data fields (offset +0xc)\n   c. Use default empty string constant if node string is NULL\n   d. Perform case-insensitive string comparison using _stricmp\n   e. If source string < destination string (negative result):\n      - Extract next source node for link manipulation\n      - Relink pointers to insert source node before destination\n      - Update all four link pointers (next/prev on both nodes)\n      - Advance source pointer to newly extracted node\n   f. Otherwise advance destination pointer to next node\n5. Tail merge: if source list has remaining nodes after main loop:\n   - Link remaining source nodes to end of destination list\n   - Update all link pointers for clean merge\n6. Update destination list count by adding source list count (offset +0x8)\n7. Zero source list count to reflect empty state\n\nParameters:\n\nthis: ConfigContainer pointer to destination list container\npSourceList: ConfigContainer pointer to source list container to merge in\n\nReturns:\n\nvoid: Modifies destination list in-place, empties source list\n\nSpecial Cases:\n\nIf pSourceList equals this, function returns immediately with no changes\nNULL string pointers default to global empty string reference (_C_exref)\nMaintains sorted order based on case-insensitive string comparison\n\nStructure Layout:\n\nConfigContainer (12 bytes):\nOffset | Size | Field        | Type       | Description\n-------|------|--------------|------------|----------------------------------\n  0x0  |  4   | pFirstNode   | ListNode*  | Pointer to first list node\n  0x4  |  4   | pLastNode    | ListNode*  | Pointer to last list node  \n  0x8  |  4   | dwNodeCount  | uint       | Number of nodes in list\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n\n0x4 - Offset to list head pointer in ConfigContainer\n0x8 - Offset to count field in ConfigContainer  \n0xc - Offset to string pointer in ListNode\n0x6800b0fc - Global pointer to default empty string constant (_C_exref)",
