      "comment": "Validates message data and sets entity validation flags.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Call global validation function with message data parameters\n2. Obtain entity pointer by calling entity lookup function with validation result  \n3. Check if entity pointer is valid and global flag is enabled\n4. Set validation flags (0x4020020) on entity at offset 0xc4\n\nParameters:\ndwEntityId - Entity identifier passed to entity lookup function\ndwMessageData - Message data to validate through global validation function\n\nReturns:\nNone (void function)\n\nSpecial Cases:\nIf entity lookup returns NULL, no flags are set\nIf global flag (DAT_68021378) is zero, no flags are set despite valid entity\n\nMagic Numbers:\n0x4020020 - Validation flag bits set in entity structure\n0xc4 - Offset to flags field in entity structure (196 decimal)\n\nFlag Bits:\n0x4020020 - Combined validation state flags\n  0x20 (bit 5) - Basic validation passed \n  0x20000 (bit 17) - Message structure validated\n  0x4000000 (bit 26) - Entity state synchronized",
