      "comment": "Initialize all function pointers for the game hooking system.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Get secondary module handle from global pointer\n2. Resolve function addresses from secondary module using GetProcAddress by ordinal\n3. Store resolved addresses in global function pointer variables  \n4. Get primary module base address from global pointer\n5. Calculate function addresses in primary module by adding fixed offsets to base\n6. Store calculated addresses in global function pointer variables\n\nParameters:\nNone\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value\n\nMagic Numbers Reference:\n0x279d - Ordinal for first secondary module function\n0x2a4a - Ordinal for GetMessageType function  \n0x299e - Ordinal for third secondary module function\n0x2812 - Ordinal for fourth secondary module function\n0x277f - Ordinal for fifth secondary module function\n0x286a - Ordinal for sixth secondary module function\n0x285b - Ordinal for ValidateMessage function\n0x27be - Ordinal for ValidatePlayerAction function\n0x2713 - Ordinal for ninth secondary module function\n0x271e - Ordinal for ResourceLookupFunction\n0x1280 - Offset for first primary module function\n0xe1d90 - Offset for second primary module function\n0xa22e0 - Offset for third primary module function\n0x200e0 - Offset for fourth primary module function\n0x24950 - Offset for GetEntityFromId function\n0x20760 - Offset for EntityProcessor function\n0xb8610 - Offset for seventh primary module function\n0x85b60 - Offset for eighth primary module function\n0xa9610 - Offset for ninth primary module function\n0xf22c0 - Offset for FinalizationCallback function\n0xb17b0 - Offset for InitCallback function\n0xf2380 - Offset for twelfth primary module function\n0xef650 - Offset for thirteenth primary module function\n0xf829c - Offset for fourteenth primary module function\n0x1220 - Offset for fifteenth primary module function\n0x8e6f0 - Offset for sixteenth primary module function\n0xa240b - Offset for seventeenth primary module functi