      "comment": "/*\n * GameMessageHandler - Diablo II Game Server Message Handler\n *\n * Algorithm:\n * 1. Validate global server state flag (ram0x68021482)\n * 2. Check message type against valid ranges (0x6c, 0x78, < 0x85)\n * 3. Retrieve game object flags using player/object ID from offset 0x28\n * 4. Validate object has required flags (bit 8 set, bit 16 clear)\n * 5. Set object processing flag (bit 16) to prevent re-entry\n * 6. Call actual message handler with appropriate parameters\n * 7. Return handler result or 0 if validation fails\n *\n * Parameters:\n * @pGameObject   - Pointer to game object/player structure containing ID at offset 0x28\n * @dwMessageType - Message type identifier validated against ranges (0x6c, 0x78, 0x85)\n * @dwParam1      - First message parameter passed through to handler\n * @dwParam2      - Second message parameter passed through to handler  \n * @dwParam3      - Third message parameter passed through to handler\n * @dwParam4      - Fourth message parameter passed through to handler\n * @dwParam5      - Fifth message parameter (may be overridden to 0x14d)\n * @dwParam6      - Sixth message parameter passed through to handler\n *\n * Returns:\n * @return        - Result from handler function on success, 0 on validation failure\n *                 Handler function pointer stored at DAT_6802152a\n *                 Zero indicates invalid object state or message type\n */",
